  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">AWEPA 1998</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">AWEPA 1998</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">St&#xF6;det till AWEPA omfattar budgetst&#xF6;d samt st&#xF6;d f&#xF6;r insatser i Mocambique och Stora Sj&#xF6;arna. En liten insats f&#xF6;r kvinnliga  kommunalpolitiker i Namibia och beredning av program i Swaziland. Inget mer st&#xF6;d b&#xF6;r ges till AWEPA under 1998.  St&#xF6;det suspenderat i sept 1998. Undantag f&#xF6;r Moc</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The support to AWEPA comprises budget support and projects in Mocambique and the Great Lakes. A small project regarding training of women councillors in Namibia and preparation of a possible support to Swaziland. No more support should be given to AWEPA during 1998. Support suspended in Sept, exc Moc.-</narrative>
  </description>
